no body for callee
--
N5008 [dcl.fct.default]/4, [temp.mem]/1, [dcl.fct]/5 (default arguments are
not part of the parameter-type-list): the default on the in-class
declaration of S::m made the declaration's and the definition's parameter
lists compare unequal, so the definition's body was never attached ("no
body for callee", bin53).  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program
(-std=c++98), and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
